            "body": "Thanks for the fix! My main comment is that I feel applying clamp in process_tokens() is already late that the mooncake store scheduler has done the bookkeeping before the clamp happens. \n\nAlso we need to be careful about clamping for hybrid linear models with mamba states, where we may not have the mamba state after the clamp.",
